  "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a tender, affectionate moment between two men and a young child, visually representing a loving family unit. The overlaid text, however, is deliberately hateful and inflammatory, using the image to propagate a false and dangerous association between gay marriage and pedophilia. This is a direct attack on the LGBTQ+ community, leveraging the visual of a happy family to misrepresent and stigmatize a specific group based on a baseless and harmful stereotype. The intent is to incite fear, prejudice, and hatred against LGBTQ+ individuals by falsely equating their relationships with child sexual abuse, which is a form of hate speech and harmful misinformation.",
